##Requirements
Python 3.10 or higher.

##KWIC
Implemented solution of the Key Word in Context problem using the "Pipes and Filters" architectural style.

**Expected Input:

Input the text, keyword and limit number of surrounding words

Expected Result:

The program will output a sorted list of contexts, in which the keyword is centered in

8 Queens
Implemented solution of the 8 Queens problem using the "Pipes and Filters" method.

Expected Input:

Input size of the chessboard

Expected Result:

The program will output all found solutions to the "8 Queens" problem.
